Package: syslogd
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libsystem, libbsm, libxpc (>= 0-2), zlib
Description: system logging daemon and ASL tools
 Receives local and kernel messages and writes the system log.
 Includes the syslog query tool and log retention manager.
